{
  "id": 8834104852679,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Flames Flying Over Comforter with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-flames-flying-over-comforter-with-name-and-number-feb4be1ea4-feb4be1ea4",
  "body_html": "<p>Bring the excitement of the court into your bedroom with this custom comforter set by Jeminise. Perfect for basketball players and sports enthusiasts, this bedding features a bold basketball print that can be personalized with a custom name and number to make it uniquely yours.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your bedding with your own name (up to 30 characters) and number (up to 5 digits) for a truly unique sports-themed look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Fabric:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric that is lightweight, durable, and exceptionally soft to the touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Construction:</strong> Filled with a whole-piece microfiber filling featuring tight stitching to prevent the fill from shifting or clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All-Season Comfort:</strong> Designed to provide comfortable warmth and lightweight breathability suitable for year-round use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Fully machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low-heat or air-dry cycle to maintain its fluffiness.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Basketball D10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Decor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Number, Personalized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
